<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett target raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Tuesday it raised its 12-month target price on Hewlett-Packard Co to between $75 and $80 per share from $65 per share.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Laura Conigliaro was not immediately available for further comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 11/16 to 65-3/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
